Resolve the kerbside images through the manifest.

The kerbside role's three image variables do not follow the
<service>_image_full pattern which the build manifest change rewrote
upstream, because they share kerbside_tag, so that change left them
pulling by tag. Resolve them through the kolla_image_full lookup too, so
a deployer image with a build manifest pulls the Kerbside images by
digest like every other.

kerbside_base_image_full still names kerbside_api_image, as it did
before. That is an existing mistake in the kerbside role, kept here so
that this change alters only how the images are pulled.

This is a separate change rather than an amendment to the kerbside role
so that the kerbside series does not depend on the manifest change.

